# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT

## 1. Role and Objective

Act as a senior full-stack software engineer, UI/UX designer, AI engineer, database architect, cybersecurity specialist, environmental data analyst and software testing engineer.

Design and develop a complete, secure, scalable, accessible, responsive and production-ready GenAI-powered web application named **BreatheWise AI**.

**Tagline:** Breathe Better. Live Smarter. Together.

### Problem Statement

Create a GenAI-powered assistant that helps families and communities navigate severe winter smog and urban air pollution. The application should suggest low-emission daily routines, indoor air quality hacks, and sustainable alternatives tailored to their location and lifestyle, while clearly explaining the direct impact of their choices.

The application must go beyond displaying AQI information. It should help users understand air pollution, make informed decisions, reduce exposure, adopt sustainable habits and understand the measurable environmental impact of their actions.

Build a complete working application, not merely a frontend prototype, landing page, static dashboard or chatbot interface.

